+  @<NAME>/
    |
    |-- <VERSION>/
    |   |-- BUILD.bazel
@@ -55,14 +55,14 @@ To construct the arguments passed to [`rctx.download_and_extract`] it uses the
 
 TL;DR, the repo can be used as follows:
 
-- `@<REPO_NAME>//:<REPO_NAME>`: points to the `:files` target of the
